{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/05e026ddc5838a676cbda8f8028d6ca1.avif?t=1755026257\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Skyclimbers is a unique blend of city-building simulation, RPG survival, and deep world building within a carefully crafted anime inspired multi dimensional universe.&quot;</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>City Building</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/c073cb3cec397eb659b030aa9ba7f823.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/c073cb3cec397eb659b030aa9ba7f823.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/c073cb3cec397eb659b030aa9ba7f823.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your kingdom using a unique mixture of top-down controls and third person mechanics to place blueprints or free build. Harvest resources, assign villager roles, and expand!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track food, resources, and economies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build barracks and command armies\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight off raids from Void and Hostile Factions\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RPG Classes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/b680fc33ab358db05c830290fdcd833d.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/b680fc33ab358db05c830290fdcd833d.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/b680fc33ab358db05c830290fdcd833d.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose between one of 5 classes, each with its own equipment and skill tree based on which elemental Dynasty you choose. Character creation allows you to mix and match styles with each class, and Dynasty.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Class specific progression and equipment\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elemental combo mixing through gear\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique sub class variants within regional districts\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Monster Taming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/fd633bcba4026074bc57a8d908408fce.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/fd633bcba4026074bc57a8d908408fce.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/fd633bcba4026074bc57a8d908408fce.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tame monsters in the open world using your Sentius Gauntlet. Each Sentius can level up and evolve into new forms, each with distinct elemental movesets.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture Sentius unique to each Dynasty\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy up to three at once for combat\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mounts include flying, climbing, and swimming\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survival </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/fd517eb4d593f0592370a0d71d5c3f76.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/fd517eb4d593f0592370a0d71d5c3f76.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/fd517eb4d593f0592370a0d71d5c3f76.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend yourself against opposing native clans that will expand and siege your territories, and a challenging terrain that will test your will.\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hostile clans spawn bases near you and expand\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather food and resources to keep your character alive\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build relations through conquest or trade\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/0643d8da0cafa3c04c238442d9dc22b0.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/0643d8da0cafa3c04c238442d9dc22b0.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/0643d8da0cafa3c04c238442d9dc22b0.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every continent is procedurally generated, and contains 5 distinct biomes. Planets spawn dozens of continents for the player to discover, each with a unique seed.\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes are limited in size, except for the infinite ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traveling ocean borders by ship can cue new continents\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome has its own flora, fauna, and environmental profile\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will command your units to defeat enemy armies, and fight alongisde a permanent retinue. Play with up to 5 friends in locally hosted co - op to create an empire together and share your Dynasty traits.</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Is optional, players get the same content offline\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI units include small groups to large battalions\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third party server support for larger private hosting\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1362000?t=1755026257","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755026257","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/18475ae6