8442d9dc22b0.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every continent is procedurally generated, and contains 5 distinct biomes. Planets spawn dozens of continents for the player to discover, each with a unique seed.\u00a0</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Biomes are limited in size, except for the infinite ocean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traveling ocean borders by ship can cue new continents\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each biome has its own flora, fauna, and environmental profile\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Together</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.poster.avif?t=1755026257\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.webm?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/d2268a72d2c9b92af426608d844a8172.mp4?t=1755026257\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You will command your units to defeat enemy armies, and fight alongisde a permanent retinue. Play with up to 5 friends in locally hosted co - op to create an empire together and share your Dynasty traits.</strong>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op Is optional, players get the same content offline\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AI units include small groups to large battalions\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third party server support for larger private hosting\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/extras/e1083d2f25ec7e1f3d999da2e7380f63.webp?t=1755026257\" width=460 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Paratope"],"dlc":[1510170],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1362000/65a8537d96a51a44731515184b13c567e78eed14/header.jpg?t=1755026257","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 @PARATOPE\u2122, LLC","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-6500 or</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11.0</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1362000/861351/c9f7a40d6a6fd4457a40b1adb38f51f808f2604d/1751227170/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743470691","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1362000/861351/c9f7a40d6a6fd4457a40b1adb38f51f808f2604d/1751227170/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743470691","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1362000/861351/c9f7a40d6a6fd4457a40b1adb38f51f808f2604d/1751227170/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1743470691","id"